// Under `pin sid = context.input.user` on every kind, a Login response whose `input.user` is
// mallory logs `sid: "alice"`. The pin is symmetric, so both reject it, and alice's `Read` is
// denied; after a login in her own `sid` it is allowed.
permit (principal, action == Drupe::Action::"Read", resource)
when temporal {
    formerly within 1h Drupe::Action::"Login"::response{}
};
